Lowest</th></tr><tr><th scope="row">Near Loris</th><td><span class="l">Middle price</span>$285,000</td><td><span class="l">Half sold between</span>$225,000 to $355,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">City of Conway</th><td><span class="l">Middle price</span>$265,000</td><td><span class="l">Half sold between</span>$220,000 to $340,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">City of Loris</th><td><span class="l">Middle price</span>$234,000</td><td><span class="l">Half sold between</span>$207,000 to $280,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Find out where your home falls in that range</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Send the address. An agent tells you where in your area's range your home falls, and why.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="#lead-form">Show me where mine falls</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="prices-now"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Prices now">Are home prices dropping in Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">No. House prices in Horry County have been about flat for a year, after rising about half in the four years before.</p><figure style="margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:760px"><svg class="hv-n" viewBox="0 0 300 186" role="img" aria-label="Line chart of house prices in Horry County, as the change since mid-2021, by quarter, from the federal house price index. Prices were about 28 percent lower in early 2016, rose to about 51 percent above mid-2021 by mid-2025, and have been about flat since, at 52 percent above in the latest quarter."><defs><linearGradient id="hvFillhv-n" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#c4783a" stop-opacity="